{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#card-zh","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"气泡提示音（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在整轮任务输出停止时播放一串原创气泡提示音。它在浏览器端监听会话状态变化，并在任务从运行中转为空闲时触发播放。主要功能包括过滤子代理会话、对短时间内的多个完成事件去重、显示静音按钮，以及记住静音状态。适合希望在切换会话或查看其他页面时仍能听到任务完成提醒的 DSH Web 用户。使用时需在浏览器打开 DSH 页面并先进行一次点击或键盘交互以解锁音频；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:390-423","lib/client.js:594-648"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#card-en","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Bubble Chime plays a bubbly sound when a DSH Web task finishes. It watches session state, ignores subagents, and deduplicates nearby completions. A composer button toggles and remembers mute. Keep the page open and interact once to unlock browser audio; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:390-423","lib/client.js:594-648"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#intent-1","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"想让 DSH 每轮回答结束时响一声提醒我。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:390-423"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#intent-2","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"我切去别的会话时，怎么知道当前任务已经跑完？","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:594-632"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#intent-3","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"能不能在浏览器里给我一个可静音的任务完成音效？","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:106-119","lib/client.js:634-648"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#intent-4","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"不想让每个子代理结束都响，能只提示整轮任务吗？","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:407-423"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#intent-5","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Play a sound when my DSH task completes, even if I am viewing another session.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:390-423","lib/client.js:594-632"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#intent-6","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Can I mute a browser chime for completed tasks and keep that preference?","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:106-119","lib/client.js:634-648"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#feature-1","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"气泡提示音的功能「整轮完成提醒」：监听会话运行状态从 true 变为 false 时播放提示音，并忽略子代理会话；短时间内多个完成事件会合并为一次提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:390-423"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#feature-2","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"气泡提示音的功能「静音切换」：点击输入框下方的气泡按钮即可关闭或恢复提示音，状态写入浏览器 localStorage，供之后打开页面时读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:82-119","lib/client.js:634-648"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#feature-3","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"气泡提示音的功能「浏览器音频播放」：播放内嵌的 WAV 提示音，优先使用 Web Audio 解码和播放；浏览器不支持或解码失败时可回退到 audio 元素。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:201-240","lib/client.js:261-310"]}
{"unit_id":"cccchensy__dsh-bubble#caveat-1","repo":"cccchensy/dsh-bubble","commit":"1560bcbe93842a2b158916368925a348cd39d93b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"气泡提示音 使用前须知：浏览器需先有一次点击或键盘交互才能解锁音频；页面关闭后不会播放，静音状态保存在 localStorage。（见 lib/client.js:82-119、lib/client.js:320-359）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:82-119","lib/client.js:320-359"]}
